From: HempFiend <17104973+jaidenscool1@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 10:26:40 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] USCL app: own name and settings folder, USCL > Online
 panel (set up, host/join, services)

The window title and app name say USCL, and settings/cache live in
~/.config/uscl and ~/.cache/uscl so a regular RPCS3 stays untouched.
USCL > Online... sets this PC up for online play (RPCN on the session
tunnel, Demonware names to our server) and hosts or joins a Steam session
by starting uscl-rpcn, dw-server and uscl-bridge from next to the
executable (data templates from share/uscl or uscl-data).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
